    (MS (mkR ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 (Z_to_bv 64 sc) (Z_to_bv 64 G) (Z_to_bv 64 xa) a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7
             (Z_to_bv 64 (-1)) (wz nd) s4 s5 (Z_to_bv 64 RMLOCK) s7 (wz size) (wz cnt) s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
